{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"54984","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/54984","key":"SV-8857","renderedFields":{"statuscategorychangedate":"Today 4:59 AM","issuetype":null,"timespent":null,"project":null,"customfield_10351":"","fixVersions":null,"aggregatetimespent":null,"statusCategory":null,"resolution":null,"resolutiondate":null,"workratio":null,"watches":null,"issuerestriction":null,"lastViewed":"Today 8:31 AM","created":"Tuesday 10:19 PM","customfield_10021":null,"customfield_10385":null,"priority":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10016":null,"customfield_10019":null,"timeestimate":null,"aggregatetimeoriginalestimate":null,"versions":null,"customfield_10418":null,"customfield_10419":null,"issuelinks":null,"assignee":null,"updated":"Today 5:00 AM","status":null,"components":null,"timeoriginalestimate":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Description\"></a>Description</h3>\n\n<p>The work order filters on the left of the Schedule can be switched on one at a time but not switched off in one go - there is no 'Clear all'. There is also nothing on the Filters button to show that filters are currently applied or how many, so a planner can easily be looking at a filtered list and not realise it, and then has to hunt through three groups of tick boxes to undo it.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Branch%2FEnvironment\"></a>Branch / Environment</h3>\n\n<p>Branch tested: <a href=\"https://sv8685.qa.shopview.com/schedule\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://sv8685.qa.shopview.com/schedule</a> · API host: <a href=\"https://sv8685api.qa.shopview.com\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://sv8685api.qa.shopview.com</a> · Build marker (meta app-version): v3.5-4873abe · index.html last-modified Tue, 04 Aug 2026 14:47:39 GMT, etag 9b4b1fc776ebbfb04a9a0ca051d847f7 · Organisation d55bc308-e61a-438d-b5f1-c7a73c89d49f · Location: Staging Heavy Duty - 9919 (b3c8c820-f815-4cf1-8938-10956c5ee71a, timezone America/Edmonton) · Signed in as admin@shopview.com (Administrator) · Observed 2026-08-04, 16:00-19:00 UTC.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Stepstoreproduce\"></a>Steps to reproduce</h3>\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open the Schedule.</li>\n\t<li>Click 'Filters' in the left-hand panel.</li>\n\t<li>Tick 'Unassigned' under Assignment and 'Approved' under Status.</li>\n\t<li>Close the popover and note the work order list is now narrowed.</li>\n\t<li>Look at the Filters button for any badge or count showing that filters are on.</li>\n\t<li>Open the popover again and look for a 'Clear all' control.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedbehaviour\"></a>Expected behaviour</h3>\n\n<p>The Filters button carries a small count of how many filters are applied, and the popover has a 'Clear all' that resets every filter in one click.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Currentbehaviour\"></a>Current behaviour</h3>\n\n<p>There is no count on the button and no 'Clear all' anywhere in the popover. Each tick box has to be unticked individually.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Images\"></a>Images</h3>\n\n<p>No screenshot is attached. The evidence for this ticket is a captured DOM/state reading rather than a visual difference; the exact values are in the technical section below.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Technicaldetailsfordevelopers\"></a>Technical details for developers</h3>\n\n<p>Enumerated the popover's contents: heading 'FILTERS' then checkbox_sidebar_assignment_unassigned / <em>assigned, checkbox_sidebar_status</em></p>\n{estimate,approved,in_progress,declined,ready_for_review,complete,invoiced,paid}\n<p> and checkbox_sidebar_priority_</p>\n{high,medium,low}\n<p>, each with its live count. No clear-all button and no badge element on button_sidebar_filters. Spec section 5.1: 'Filters live behind a \"Filter\" button (with an active-count badge); there are no assignment tabs. Applying a filter narrows the flat card list, and \"Clear all\" resets in one click.'</p>","customfield_10015":null,"timetracking":{},"security":null,"aggregatetimeestimate":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/59392","id":"59392","filename":"Reproduced on QA - 8857.mp4","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","accountId":"712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/32"},"displayName":"Ayesha Khan","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"Today 4:15 AM","size":"2.16 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392"},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/59397","id":"59397","filename":"Verified in QA.mp4","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","accountId":"712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/32"},"displayName":"Ayesha Khan","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"Today 4:54 AM","size":"1.77 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59397"}],"summary":null,"creator":null,"subtasks":null,"customfield_10285":"","reporter":null,"customfield_10044":null,"aggregateprogress":null,"customfield_10046":null,"customfield_10047":null,"environment":"","customfield_10318":null,"duedate":null,"customfield_10518":null,"progress":null,"votes":null,"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/54984/comment/74584","id":"74584","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","accountId":"712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/32"},"displayName":"Ayesha Khan","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"body":"<p>Reproduced on QA (admin, Schedule sidebar Filters). Confirmed: no \"Clear all\" in the popover, and the Filters button shows no active-filter count. Matches PRD §5.1 (\"Filter button with an active-count badge… Clear all resets in one click\"). No new ticket — covered here.</p>\n\n<p><div class=\"embeddedObject\"><object classid=\"clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B\" codebase=\"https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab\" data=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\" height=\"380\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" ><param name=\"data\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\"/><param name=\"src\" value=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\"/><param name=\"type\" value=\"video/mp4\"/><embed height=\"380\" pluginspage=\"https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/\" src=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/59392?stream=true\" type=\"video/mp4\" width=\"742\" /></object></div></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" data-account-id=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" accountid=\"712020:6d590212-5c9b-4135-ae11-277f3826110e\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Bilal Muzamil</a> <a href=\"https://shopview.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" data-account-id=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" accountid=\"712020:92c46428-d353-4811-9672-e47eeb410d09\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Branko Cicovic</a> </p>","updateAuthor":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3A67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","accountId":"712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6-dbf94204abba/4980e208-2cbf-4704-a83a-6fc499e6b7fb/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:67f76d27-9119-4cb6-93c6